{
  "abstract": "We have searched for possible narrow resonances produced in e + e \u2212 annihilation at Adone, in the mass regions 1910\u20132545 MeV and 2970\u20133090 MeV. No evidence has been found for narrow resonances, within the sensitivity of the present work: we deduce an upper limit on the energy integrated resonant cross section of about 10% of the J/\u03c8(3100) corresponding value.",
